WEBVTT

00:01:47.696 --> 00:01:50.198
It's cold!

00:01:50.198 --> 00:01:51.495
Huh?

00:01:53.568 --> 00:01:54.865
Snow?

00:01:57.506 --> 00:02:00.737
No wonder it's so cold.

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:06.804
There!

00:02:07.382 --> 00:02:11.079
Ryo-Ohki, this is "snow"! Did you know that?

00:02:35.810 --> 00:02:37.937
Yay!

00:03:17.619 --> 00:03:20.088
What's wrong, Ryoko?

00:03:20.088 --> 00:03:22.791
I don't like cold weather.

00:03:22.791 --> 00:03:26.695
Tenchi, can you stop the snow?

00:03:26.695 --> 00:03:29.698
You want me to stop the snow?

00:03:29.698 --> 00:03:34.636
Bad weather is one thing I hate
about this deserted remote planet.

00:03:34.636 --> 00:03:37.872
Sasami doesn't seem to mind
the snow that much, though.

00:03:37.872 --> 00:03:40.075
Wow!

00:03:40.075 --> 00:03:42.202
- Wonderful!
- Tenchi!

00:03:42.644 --> 00:03:44.379
Breakfast will be ready anytime now.

00:03:44.379 --> 00:03:46.681
Go get Grandpa from the shrine.

00:03:46.681 --> 00:03:48.171
Okay.

00:04:10.605 --> 00:04:13.540
How long has it been since
the last time we had snow?

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:28.885
Grandpa! Grandpa!

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:35.287
Huh? Are you still asleep?

00:04:36.631 --> 00:04:40.123
Come on, wake up! Grandpa?

00:04:50.612 --> 00:04:52.307
Hey, wait a minute.

00:04:53.248 --> 00:04:59.087
Grandpa, Dad said it's time for breakfast.

00:04:59.087 --> 00:05:01.790
There! Your opponent may
have two weapons, you know.

00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:04.426
Never become overconfident, Tenchi.

00:05:04.426 --> 00:05:06.328
Uh, all right.

00:05:06.328 --> 00:05:09.331
We'll practice more later.

00:05:09.331 --> 00:05:11.833
I'll be waiting for you at the
regular spot after our meal, okay?

00:05:11.833 --> 00:05:15.036
What? Isn't it too cold for that
because of the snow and stuff?

00:05:15.036 --> 00:05:16.765
Have I made myself clear?

00:05:21.810 --> 00:05:23.712
Stay still, okay?

00:05:23.712 --> 00:05:25.407
Yes, Ma'am.

00:05:25.947 --> 00:05:28.347
I am so sorry, Princess Sasami.

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:32.287
Ah, Tenchi, where are you going?

00:05:32.287 --> 00:05:35.347
I have to swing this
around a little with Grandpa.

00:05:36.257 --> 00:05:38.293
Hi, Tenchi.

00:05:38.293 --> 00:05:39.961
Going shopping or something?

00:05:39.961 --> 00:05:42.230
Nothing like that. I gotta go to work.

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:43.732
But today is Sunday.

00:05:43.732 --> 00:05:47.469
I have to finish up
drawing a plan by Tuesday.

00:05:47.469 --> 00:05:49.003
Drawing a plan?

00:05:49.003 --> 00:05:52.769
Uh-huh. Dad draws house plans.

00:05:54.876 --> 00:05:58.880
The clients never give me
enough time to get my work done.

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:04.352
I'd like to take one day off a week at least!

00:06:04.352 --> 00:06:06.377
I wanna take a day off!
I wanna take a day off!

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:29.344
Hmm, can you handle these, then?

00:06:29.344 --> 00:06:30.868
Here!

00:06:37.051 --> 00:06:39.451
You still have a lot to learn.

00:06:50.432 --> 00:06:51.699
Huh?

00:06:51.699 --> 00:06:53.735
What could that be?

00:06:53.735 --> 00:06:55.870
That must be...

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:57.861
That's...

00:07:04.179 --> 00:07:06.511
I thought they would be
around here somewhere.

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:35.844
Hmph, are you giving up already?

00:07:35.844 --> 00:07:37.471
No, not yet!

00:07:41.716 --> 00:07:45.620
Tenchi's sword-handling form
resembles that of Jurai's royal family.

00:07:45.620 --> 00:07:49.647
Huh? Is it you over there, Ayeka?

00:07:50.792 --> 00:07:54.193
Well, if I am disturbing you...

00:07:55.196 --> 00:07:59.033
Oh, did you bring refreshments?

00:07:59.033 --> 00:08:02.161
Okay, Tenchi. Today's lesson is over.

00:08:23.958 --> 00:08:25.983
Oh, Mr. Masaki...

00:08:27.395 --> 00:08:30.732
Ah, Reiko. Did I ask you
to do something today?

00:08:30.732 --> 00:08:34.736
Oh, no. It's just that
I left something here. Huh?

00:08:34.736 --> 00:08:37.364
Those flowers... What's the occasion?

00:08:39.207 --> 00:08:42.810
Ah, I wanted to give them to you.

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:46.712
Mr. Masaki, you are always
kidding around, aren't you?

00:08:53.988 --> 00:08:58.426
Why are you practicing
with the sword, Tenchi?

00:08:58.426 --> 00:09:04.966
I've always done it since my childhood,
so I never thought about it much.

00:09:04.966 --> 00:09:08.436
Come to think of it,
why am I practicing, anyway?

00:09:08.436 --> 00:09:10.734
You are strange, Tenchi.

00:09:14.909 --> 00:09:17.879
- Ayeka!
- Ayeka!

00:09:17.879 --> 00:09:18.980
Ayeka!

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:21.972
Sasami! Why are you in such a hurry?

00:09:23.117 --> 00:09:24.285
It's Ryu-Oh.

00:09:24.285 --> 00:09:25.820
What? Ryu-Oh?

00:09:25.820 --> 00:09:28.556
Please look toward the lake.

00:09:28.556 --> 00:09:30.421
Toward the lake?

00:09:33.294 --> 00:09:34.852
Could it be...

00:09:52.814 --> 00:09:54.649
Ryu-Oh?

00:09:54.649 --> 00:09:58.987
What? Is that the ship you came here on?

00:09:58.987 --> 00:10:01.589
Yes. It is regenerating itself.

00:10:01.589 --> 00:10:06.661
Ryu-Oh's current regeneration level is 0.05%.

00:10:06.661 --> 00:10:09.664
Since it is rooted to
the wreck of the main ship,

00:10:09.664 --> 00:10:13.301
it cannot function as an independent unit.

00:10:13.301 --> 00:10:14.569
That is all right.

00:10:14.569 --> 00:10:18.106
I have always had Ryu-Oh
ever since I was a little girl.

00:10:18.106 --> 00:10:22.110
I did not think it could
regenerate itself on this planet.

00:10:22.110 --> 00:10:24.601
I'm happy for you, Ayeka.

00:10:48.136 --> 00:10:51.572
Oh, Kiyone, have you caught a cold?

00:10:51.572 --> 00:10:55.543
Looks like it. It got chilly
so suddenly yesterday.

00:10:55.543 --> 00:10:57.909
I hate this!

00:10:59.013 --> 00:11:03.384
My grandfather told me that
you can get rid of a cold quickly

00:11:03.384 --> 00:11:06.888
if you give it to someone else.

00:11:06.888 --> 00:11:12.485
I have had a slight cold since
yesterday, but I already feel great now!

00:11:13.361 --> 00:11:16.330
I got this from you, then!

00:11:18.132 --> 00:11:20.001
I'm home!

00:11:20.001 --> 00:11:21.235
Hey, Dad!

00:11:21.235 --> 00:11:22.637
Dinner is ready!

00:11:22.637 --> 00:11:24.305
Oh! Is that so?

00:11:24.305 --> 00:11:25.807
Nobuyuki...

00:11:25.807 --> 00:11:27.608
What's up, Father?

00:11:27.608 --> 00:11:30.878
How about having some drinks later?

00:11:30.878 --> 00:11:32.680
That sounds like a great idea.

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:35.649
We can enjoy <i>sake</i>
while watching the snow.

00:11:40.054 --> 00:11:41.355
Here, drink up.

00:11:41.355 --> 00:11:43.255
Whoo, that'll be plenty.

00:11:46.861 --> 00:11:49.097
Well, did you have to go to the office today?

00:11:49.097 --> 00:11:50.898
You know what?

00:11:50.898 --> 00:11:55.403
I designed six houses
this month alone. Six houses!

00:11:55.403 --> 00:11:56.337
Is that right?

00:11:56.337 --> 00:11:59.040
I'm definitely overworking.

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:01.099
Is that right?

00:12:03.945 --> 00:12:05.880
Snow, huh.

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:07.215
Tenchi.

00:12:07.215 --> 00:12:09.050
What's the matter, Tenchi?

00:12:09.050 --> 00:12:11.152
Come on. Have some <i>sake.</i>

00:12:11.152 --> 00:12:13.221
Ah, no, thank you. I'll pass.

00:12:13.221 --> 00:12:15.790
Why not? Here. Have some.

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:17.558
Hey.

00:12:17.558 --> 00:12:19.026
Give me that!

00:12:19.026 --> 00:12:21.654
Tenchi says he does not want to drink.

00:12:23.564 --> 00:12:25.767
Yikes!

00:12:25.767 --> 00:12:29.669
You sure can drink!

00:12:30.938 --> 00:12:34.842
Oh, no! We are out of <i>sake!</i>

00:12:34.842 --> 00:12:36.711
What? A <i>sake</i> crisis already?

00:12:36.711 --> 00:12:39.981
- Tenchi, go get some more from the store.
- Why me?

00:12:39.981 --> 00:12:42.183
Just go get it.

00:12:42.183 --> 00:12:44.651
Could you please go to the store for us?

00:12:49.423 --> 00:12:50.992
Here, Kiyone.

00:12:50.992 --> 00:12:52.627
Have this. It's sort of like eggnog.

00:12:52.627 --> 00:12:54.028
What is it?

00:12:54.028 --> 00:12:57.293
This is a special cold remedy on this planet.

00:13:02.904 --> 00:13:04.531
What are you thinking?

00:13:08.276 --> 00:13:10.611
Where is Tenchi anyway?

00:13:10.611 --> 00:13:14.816
Now, now. I will open
up the special <i>sake</i> for us.

00:13:14.816 --> 00:13:18.616
Oh, it's a special brew: "Beautiful Girl."

00:13:24.058 --> 00:13:27.695
This is my favorite.

00:13:27.695 --> 00:13:30.464
It's my favorite, too.

00:13:30.464 --> 00:13:35.269
You're more like a son
to me than a son-in-law.

00:13:35.269 --> 00:13:37.237
Do you think so?

00:13:41.909 --> 00:13:43.744
You know what?

00:13:43.744 --> 00:13:45.213
What is it?

00:13:45.213 --> 00:13:48.449
I used to hate the snow.

00:13:48.449 --> 00:13:50.918
What a coincidence!

00:13:50.918 --> 00:13:53.011
I used to dislike the snow, too.

00:13:55.423 --> 00:13:56.913
But...

00:13:58.826 --> 00:14:02.489
...I don't hate it that much anymore.

00:14:04.966 --> 00:14:07.301
The snow of our memories...

00:14:07.301 --> 00:14:09.667
Let's drink to them.

00:14:22.116 --> 00:14:24.914
Those guys are so demanding.

00:14:47.975 --> 00:14:49.772
Oh!

00:14:57.852 --> 00:14:59.820
Welcome back, Tenchi.

00:14:59.820 --> 00:15:03.586
Sasami, where are my dad and grandpa?

00:15:04.759 --> 00:15:10.459
H-Huh? Wh-What's wrong with me?

00:15:11.666 --> 00:15:13.067
Tenchi!

00:15:13.067 --> 00:15:15.303
L-I'm all right.

00:15:15.303 --> 00:15:19.262
I must have been too
active in this cold weather.

00:15:21.809 --> 00:15:23.978
What's wrong with you, Tenchi?

00:15:23.978 --> 00:15:25.946
Tenchi, are you okay?

00:15:27.315 --> 00:15:29.840
This is bad! Tenchi is...

00:15:43.931 --> 00:15:46.734
What are you doing here
so late, Princess Sasami?

00:15:46.734 --> 00:15:49.136
Tenchi seems to be sick or something.

00:15:49.136 --> 00:15:51.439
He's breathing heavily and sweating a lot.

00:15:51.439 --> 00:15:53.441
Please try to calm down.

00:15:53.441 --> 00:15:55.643
He is not feeling well,
and he has a fever as well!

00:15:55.643 --> 00:15:57.645
Those sound like the symptoms of the flu.

00:15:57.645 --> 00:15:59.313
It certainly sounds like the flu to me.

00:15:59.313 --> 00:16:01.178
Can you do something about it?

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:06.020
How about applying
some of the sap from Ryu-Oh?

00:16:06.020 --> 00:16:09.456
Ryu-Oh's sap? What a great idea!

00:16:21.035 --> 00:16:22.593
Please...

00:16:26.440 --> 00:16:29.967
Please help Tenchi.

00:18:23.958 --> 00:18:28.462
That's right. I got sick and...

00:18:28.462 --> 00:18:29.952
Sasami?

00:18:36.770 --> 00:18:39.568
Thank you, Sasami.

00:18:43.377 --> 00:18:45.174
I've got to go.

00:18:52.119 --> 00:18:57.455
I remember it was a snowy
day like today when my mom...

00:19:11.238 --> 00:19:13.729
Dad... Grandpa.

00:19:22.049 --> 00:19:23.884
Get over here, Tenchi.

00:19:23.884 --> 00:19:25.853
Say hi to your mother.

00:19:25.853 --> 00:19:27.753
Ah, sure.

00:19:30.658 --> 00:19:33.650
"Masaki Family Tomb"

00:19:36.664 --> 00:19:39.466
Both of you remembered, huh?

00:19:39.466 --> 00:19:45.539
It was also snowing on the day she died.

00:19:45.539 --> 00:19:50.177
Those flowers are the
kind Mom really liked.

00:19:50.177 --> 00:19:52.580
Well, I just...

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:57.685
Oh, I almost forgot to tell you, my dear,
Tenchi now has a lot of girlfriends.

00:19:57.685 --> 00:20:00.020
I was worried about him
being too shy with women,

00:20:00.020 --> 00:20:03.023
but he is my son, after all.

00:20:03.023 --> 00:20:04.191
Dad.

00:20:04.191 --> 00:20:07.061
I must say his sword technique still leaves
a lot of room for improvement, though.

00:20:07.061 --> 00:20:08.862
Grandpa.

00:20:08.862 --> 00:20:11.966
Well, it's about time
for me to go to the office.

00:20:11.966 --> 00:20:15.336
I have a project due tomorrow, so...

00:20:15.336 --> 00:20:18.533
I'm going back to the shrine, then.

00:20:20.741 --> 00:20:22.676
Tenchi!

00:20:22.676 --> 00:20:24.667
Don't be late for school.

00:20:25.446 --> 00:20:29.016
Tenchi?

00:20:29.016 --> 00:20:30.918
Sasami!

00:20:30.918 --> 00:20:32.853
You should be still in bed.

00:20:32.853 --> 00:20:33.954
I'm feeling fine now.

00:20:33.954 --> 00:20:36.490
But you were in such pain yesterday.

00:20:36.490 --> 00:20:38.559
You are not completely recovered yet.

00:20:38.559 --> 00:20:41.262
- But you know what?
- What?

00:20:41.262 --> 00:20:44.459
I kind of feel really good.

00:20:49.336 --> 00:20:55.643
By the way, does Ryu-Oh's sap
work on humans from this planet also?

00:20:55.643 --> 00:21:03.243
Well, Tenchi seems to be
fine, so I suppose it does.

00:22:58.365 --> 00:23:01.602
A formidable one comes after
Ryoko for the reward money.

00:23:01.602 --> 00:23:05.472
Her name is Nagi, the toughest
bounty hunter in the universe.

00:23:05.472 --> 00:23:09.276
Nagi. I can't believe she came
all the way to Earth after me.

00:23:09.276 --> 00:23:13.280
You certainly have lots of
enemies everywhere, don't you?

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:17.251
Faced with this formidable arch rival even
Ryoko can't help being in a tight spot!

00:23:17.251 --> 00:23:19.319
Next episode is: "No Need for an Arch Rival!"

00:23:19.319 --> 00:23:21.655
Which one will survive?

00:23:21.655 --> 00:23:23.987
It's unquestionably swashbuckling.
